      "persona": "Whitehat Hacker",
      "questName": "Blue Lantern Debrief",
      "questDescription": "Review the final debrief, confirm the boundary for ethical awareness testing, and distinguish marker-linked evidence from related findings with open attribution.",
      "questCompleteText": "<b>Asha Moreno:</b> The debrief preserves the evidence, protects staff, and records what is confirmed, suspected, and still open.",
      "questCharacterID": "u03_asha_moreno",
      "appScenarioID": ""
    },
    {
      "persona": "Blackhat Hacker",
      "questName": "Blue Lantern Debrief",
      "questDescription": "Review the evidence boundaries, controlled testing rules, and unresolved attribution before the Blue Lantern debrief is filed.",
      "questCompleteText": "<b>Felix Rane:</b> The report keeps useful patterns, measured results, and unresolved links separate instead of forcing a cleaner story.",
      "questCharacterID": "u03_felix_rane",
      "appScenarioID": ""
    },
    {
      "persona": "Hacktivist",
      "questName": "Blue Lantern Debrief",
      "questDescription": "Review a redacted debrief that supports public warnings while protecting targeted people and sensitive access details.",
      "questCompleteText": "<b>Imani Vale:</b> The final warning is specific enough to help the public and disciplined enough to protect the people in the evidence.",
